[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11401.11, "timestamp": "03:10:01", "text": "有些部分略显复杂。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11402.87, "timestamp": "03:10:02", "text": "我会指导你完成整个过程。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11405.19, "timestamp": "03:10:05", "text": "是的，它是比较复杂的一个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11406.79, "timestamp": "03:10:06", "text": "课程。但如果你不是在进行狂野造型，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11408.55, "timestamp": "03:10:08", "text": "应该没问题。唯一，唯一"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11409.83, "timestamp": "03:10:09", "text": "正是这一点让它如此……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11412.469, "timestamp": "03:10:12", "text": "野性形态的规则很复杂。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11414.55, "timestamp": "03:10:14", "text": "嗯，你应该没问题，因为我猜……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11416.15, "timestamp": "03:10:16", "text": "你将使用你的狂野形态"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11419.03, "timestamp": "03:10:19", "text": "大多数时候都用箭头"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11422.469, "timestamp": "03:10:22", "text": "总之，这是星形魔法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11424.469, "timestamp": "03:10:24", "text": "是的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11428.07, "timestamp": "03:10:28", "text": "我觉得我们应该没问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11429.03, "timestamp": "03:10:29", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11433.03, "timestamp": "03:10:33", "text": "耶。谢谢你今天教我。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11435.51, "timestamp": "03:10:35", "text": "帮了我很多。谢谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11438.55, "timestamp": "03:10:38", "text": "好的。周六见。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11441.59, "timestamp": "03:10:41", "text": "再见。小心。韩。谢谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11442.55, "timestamp": "03:10:42", "text": "晚安。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11449.429, "timestamp": "03:10:49", "text": "好了，以上就是韩的故事。韩。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11451.67, "timestamp": "03:10:51", "text": "抱歉没能给你们看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11455.11, "timestamp": "03:10:55", "text": "我们当时在做什么，因为……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11458.63, "timestamp": "03:10:58", "text": "呃，应该是周六的。周六"}]